          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="2451ab48">Improve the Armour Penetration characteristic of melee weapons equipped by models in the bearer's unit by 1. (Default enhancement; may be replaced with Radiant Wrath (Psychic): Both of the bearer's Smite weapon profiles have the [Anti-Monster 5+] and [Anti-Vehicle 5+] abilities.)</characteristic>
